{"design":{"context":"调整原“连点”玩点的呼吸节奏，避免玩家尚未进入呼气阶段本轮就结束。原视频仅用于提供静态起跑预备的情境背景；呼气圆环、阶段提示和专注度条均为小游戏新增界面，不代表人物真实的呼吸频率、神经激活或生理测量。","goal":"在8秒时限内完成5轮呼吸同步。每轮吸气阶段不点击，随后在较长的呼气阶段精准点击2–3次；5轮全部达标即成功。","screen":"透明背景的自绘界面包含顶部标题与累计点击数、中央呼吸圆环和当前阶段、专注度条、底部主要连点区域以及状态提示。准备阶段显示预备提示和倒计时；正式阶段显示第1至第5轮、吸气或呼气、本轮点击数及累计点击数。成功或失败时在界面中央显示结果卡片，不改变或遮挡视频事实内容。","input":"仅主要连点区域接受鼠标、触屏和触控笔操作，统一使用Pointer Events。有效点击由pointerdown产生，每次有效落点只计1次，pointerup结束按压。pointercancel清除当前活动指针，不额外补记点击，也不撤销此前已经完成的有效点击。只允许单指操作，第二指针的按下不计数。准备阶段、吸气阶段、8秒总时限结束后的点击均不计数并给出等待或超时提示。","rules":"宿主时限为8.000秒。小游戏先显示800ms预备提示，随后正式挑战持续6.000秒，分为5个1.200秒周期，每周期划分为0–300ms吸气和300–1200ms呼气。相位边界为0≤相位<300时属于吸气，300≤相位<1200时属于呼气；相位达到1200ms时进入下一轮吸气，计数不会跨轮继承。每个呼气阶段必须累计2次或3次点击：第4次有效点击落下时立即失败；轮次结束时为0次或1次立即失败，2次或3次通过。吸气阶段误点不计数，也不直接导致失败，只提示等待。5轮均以2–3次点击通过后成功。成功所需最低点击总数为10，最高为15；专注度按总有效点击数除以15展示，上限为100%。","states":"准备：显示800ms预备提示和剩余时间，倒计时期间落点忽略。进行：按性能时间戳确定当前轮次与吸/呼气阶段，实时更新本轮次数、累计次数和专注度；每到轮次边界检查上一轮结果。成功：第5轮结束后全部达标，圆环变绿、专注度满格并提交成功结果。失败：出现第4次点击或轮次结束时少于2次点击，圆环变红、连点区轻颤并提交具体失败原因。结束：无论成功或失败都锁定输入，只调用一次宿主结束接口，由宿主负责约1秒反馈和视频恢复。","feedback":"成功时显示绿色圆环、满格专注度和“节奏稳定，启动准备已就绪！”。吸气误点显示黄色“保持吸气，等待呼气提示”，呼气点击显示绿色“已记录N/3次”。第4次点击显示“节奏紊乱：第N轮点击超过3次”；轮次点击不足显示“准备度下降：第N轮需要2–3次点击”。所有结果通过api.finish提交，宿主负责后续反馈展示和原片恢复。","timeout_s":8},"javascript":"function mount(container, api) {
  const doc = container.ownerDocument || document;
  const view = doc.defaultView || window;
  const root = doc.createElement('div');
  root.className = 'mash-root';

  const hud = doc.createElement('div');
  hud.className = 'mash-hud';
  const title = doc.createElement('div');
  title.className = 'mash-title';
  title.textContent = '起跑专注';
  const stats = doc.createElement('div');
  stats.className = 'mash-stats';
  stats.setAttribute('aria-live', 'polite');
  hud.append(title, stats);

  const stage = doc.createElement('div');
  stage.className = 'mash-stage';
  const ringWrap = doc.createElement('div');
  ringWrap.className = 'mash-ring-wrap';
  const ring = doc.createElement('div');
  ring.className = 'mash-ring inhale';
  const ringCore = doc.createElement('div');
  ringCore.className = 'mash-ring-core';
  ringCore.textContent = '预备';
  ring.append(ringCore);
  const phaseText = doc.createElement('div');
  phaseText.className = 'mash-phase';
  phaseText.textContent = '准备开始';
  const cycleText = doc.createElement('div');
  cycleText.className = 'mash-cycle';
  cycleText.textContent = '第 1 / 5 轮';
  ringWrap.append(ring, phaseText, cycleText);

  const meterBox = doc.createElement('div');
  meterBox.className = 'mash-meter-box';
  const meterLabel = doc.createElement('div');
  meterLabel.className = 'mash-meter-label';
  meterLabel.textContent = '专注度';
  const meterTrack = doc.createElement('div');
  meterTrack.className = 'mash-meter-track';
  const meterFill = doc.createElement('div');
  meterFill.className = 'mash-meter-fill';
  meterTrack.append(meterFill);
  meterBox.append(meterLabel, meterTrack);
  stage.append(ringWrap, meterBox);

  const pad = doc.createElement('div');
  pad.className = 'mash-pad';
  pad.setAttribute('role', 'button');
  pad.setAttribute('aria-label', '呼气阶段连点区域');
  pad.setAttribute('tabindex', '0');
  const padTitle = doc.createElement('strong');
  padTitle.textContent = '呼气时连点';
  const padHint = doc.createElement('span');
  padHint.textContent = '每轮点击 2–3 次';
  pad.append(padTitle, padHint);

  const status = doc.createElement('div');
  status.className = 'mash-status';
  status.setAttribute('aria-live', 'assertive');
  status.textContent = '准备阶段，请等待呼吸提示。';

  const result = doc.createElement('div');
  result.className = 'mash-result';
  result.hidden = true;

  root.append(hud, stage, pad, status, result);
  container.appendChild(root);

  const PREP_MS = 800;
  const DURATION_MS = 6000;
  const CYCLE_MS = 1200;
  const INHALE_MS = 300;
  const CYCLES = 5;
  const MAX_PER_CYCLE = 3;
  const MIN_PER_CYCLE = 2;
  const MAX_TOTAL = CYCLES * MAX_PER_CYCLE;
  const counts = new Array(CYCLES).fill(0);

  let state = 'ready';
  let startAt = 0;
  let prepEndAt = 0;
  let rafId = 0;
  let prepTimer = 0;
  let nextCycleToEvaluate = 0;
  let activePointer = null;
  let totalClicks = 0;
  let lastPhaseKey = '';
  let finished = false;
  let destroyed = false;

  function reportError(error) {
    if (api && typeof api.reportError === 'function') {
      api.reportError(error && error.message ? error.message : String(error));
    }
  }

  function setStatus(message, tone) {
    status.textContent = message;
    status.className = 'mash-status' + (tone ? ' ' + tone : '');
  }

  function updateMeter() {
    const value = Math.min(100, totalClicks / MAX_TOTAL * 100);
    meterFill.style.width = value.toFixed(2) + '%';
  }

  function updateReady(now) {
    if (destroyed || state !== 'ready') return;
    const remain = Math.max(0, prepEndAt - now);
    phaseText.textContent = '预备 · ' + (remain / 1000).toFixed(1) + ' 秒';
    stats.textContent = '正式挑战 6 秒 · 共 5 轮';
    rafId = view.requestAnimationFrame(updateReady);
  }

  function updateRunning(now) {
    if (destroyed || state !== 'running') return;
    try {
      const elapsed = Math.max(0, now - startAt);
      const completedByTime = Math.min(CYCLES, Math.floor(elapsed / CYCLE_MS));

      while (nextCycleToEvaluate < completedByTime) {
        const index = nextCycleToEvaluate;
        const count = counts[index];
        if (count < MIN_PER_CYCLE) {
          finishFailure('准备度下降：第' + (index + 1) + '轮需要2–3次点击。');
          return;
        }
        nextCycleToEvaluate += 1;
      }

      if (elapsed >= DURATION_MS) {
        if (nextCycleToEvaluate < CYCLES) {
          const index = nextCycleToEvaluate;
          if (counts[index] < MIN_PER_CYCLE) {
            finishFailure('准备度下降：第' + (index + 1) + '轮需要2–3次点击。');
            return;
          }
          nextCycleToEvaluate += 1;
        }
        finishSuccess();
        return;
      }

      const cycle = Math.min(CYCLES - 1, Math.floor(elapsed / CYCLE_MS));
      const phaseOffset = elapsed - cycle * CYCLE_MS;
      const phase = phaseOffset < INHALE_MS ? 'inhale' : 'exhale';
      const phaseKey = phase + ':' + cycle;

      if (phaseKey !== lastPhaseKey) {
        lastPhaseKey = phaseKey;
        ring.classList.remove('inhale', 'exhale');
        ring.classList.add(phase);
        if (phase === 'inhale') {
          ringCore.textContent = '吸气';
          phaseText.textContent = '吸气 · 暂不点击';
          setStatus('保持吸气，等圆环变大再点击。');
        } else {
          ringCore.textContent = '呼气';
          phaseText.textContent = '呼气 · 连点 2–3 次';
          setStatus('现在有0.9秒，请连点2–3次！', 'good');
        }
      }

      cycleText.textContent = '第 ' + (cycle + 1) + ' / ' + CYCLES + ' 轮';
      stats.textContent = '本轮 ' + counts[cycle] + ' 次 · 累计 ' + totalClicks + ' 次';
      updateMeter();
      rafId = view.requestAnimationFrame(updateRunning);
    } catch (error) {
      reportError(error);
      finishFailure('小游戏运行异常，已中止本次挑战。');
    }
  }

  function beginChallenge() {
    if (destroyed || state !== 'ready') return;
    state = 'running';
    startAt = view.performance.now();
    nextCycleToEvaluate = 0;
    lastPhaseKey = '';
    ringCore.textContent = '吸气';
    phaseText.textContent = '吸气 · 暂不点击';
    cycleText.textContent = '第 1 / 5 轮';
    setStatus('保持吸气，等圆环变大再点击。');
    rafId = view.requestAnimationFrame(updateRunning);
  }

  function onPointerDown(event) {
    if (destroyed || finished) return;
    try {
      if (state === 'ready') {
        event.preventDefault();
        setStatus('还在准备，请等待预备倒计时结束。', 'warn');
        return;
      }
      if (state !== 'running') return;
      event.preventDefault();
      if (activePointer !== null) {
        setStatus('请使用单指操作；额外的按下不会计次。', 'warn');
        return;
      }

      activePointer = event.pointerId;
      try {
        pad.setPointerCapture(event.pointerId);
      } catch (ignore) {}

      const elapsed = view.performance.now() - startAt;
      if (elapsed < 0 || elapsed >= DURATION_MS) {
        setStatus('本次操作已超时，不计次。', 'warn');
        return;
      }

      const cycle = Math.min(CYCLES - 1, Math.floor(elapsed / CYCLE_MS));
      const phaseOffset = elapsed - cycle * CYCLE_MS;
      if (phaseOffset < INHALE_MS) {
        setStatus('现在是吸气阶段，本次不计数。', 'warn');
        return;
      }

      counts[cycle] += 1;
      totalClicks += 1;
      if (counts[cycle] > MAX_PER_CYCLE) {
        finishFailure('节奏紊乱：第' + (cycle + 1) + '轮点击超过3次。');
        return;
      }

      stats.textContent = '本轮 ' + counts[cycle] + ' 次 · 累计 ' + totalClicks + ' 次';
      updateMeter();
      setStatus('已记录 ' + counts[cycle] + '/3 次，继续保持节奏。', 'good');
    } catch (error) {
      reportError(error);
      finishFailure('小游戏运行异常，已中止本次挑战。');
    }
  }

  function onPointerUp(event) {
    if (activePointer === event.pointerId) activePointer = null;
  }

  function onPointerCancel(event) {
    if (activePointer === event.pointerId) activePointer = null;
    if (state === 'running') {
      setStatus('操作已取消，不会补记点击。', 'warn');
    }
  }

  function finishSuccess() {
    if (finished) return;
    finished = true;
    state = 'success';
    root.classList.add('success');
    pad.classList.add('locked');
    ring.classList.remove('inhale', 'exhale');
    ring.classList.add('success-ring');
    ringCore.textContent = '就绪';
    phaseText.textContent = '节奏稳定';
    cycleText.textContent = CYCLES + ' / ' + CYCLES + ' 轮完成';
    meterFill.style.width = '100%';
    stats.textContent = '累计 ' + totalClicks + ' 次有效点击';
    const message = '节奏稳定，启动准备已就绪！';
    status.textContent = message;
    status.className = 'mash-status good';
    result.hidden = false;
    result.className = 'mash-result success-result';
    result.textContent = message;
    try {
      api.finish({ result: 'success', message: message });
    } catch (error) {
      reportError(error);
    }
  }

  function finishFailure(message) {
    if (finished) return;
    finished = true;
    state = 'failure';
    root.classList.add('failure');
    pad.classList.add('locked');
    ring.classList.remove('inhale', 'exhale');
    ring.classList.add('failure-ring');
    ringCore.textContent = '失衡';
    phaseText.textContent = '节奏中断';
    status.textContent = message;
    status.className = 'mash-status bad';
    result.hidden = false;
    result.className = 'mash-result failure-result';
    result.textContent = message;
    try {
      api.finish({ result: 'failure', message: message });
    } catch (error) {
      reportError(error);
    }
  }

  pad.addEventListener('pointerdown', onPointerDown);
  pad.addEventListener('pointerup', onPointerUp);
  pad.addEventListener('pointercancel', onPointerCancel);

  prepEndAt = view.performance.now() + PREP_MS;
  rafId = view.requestAnimationFrame(updateReady);
  prepTimer = view.setTimeout(beginChallenge, PREP_MS);

  return {
    destroy() {
      if (destroyed) return;
      destroyed = true;
      view.clearTimeout(prepTimer);
      view.cancelAnimationFrame(rafId);
      pad.removeEventListener('pointerdown', onPointerDown);
      pad.removeEventListener('pointerup', onPointerUp);
      pad.removeEventListener('pointercancel', onPointerCancel);
      if (root.parentNode) root.parentNode.removeChild(root);
    }
  };
}","css":"#game { color: #fff; background: transparent; }
#game .mash-root, #game .mash-root * { box-sizing: border-box; }
#game .mash-root { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-height: 320px; overflow: hidden; padding: clamp(14px, 3vw, 28px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: clamp(12px, 2.4vh, 22px); color: #f7fbff; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; background: transparent; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none; }
#game .mash-hud { flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; padding: 12px 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18); border-radius: 16px; background: rgba(15,25,42,.46); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.16); }
#game .mash-title { font-size: clamp(18px, 2.5vw, 25px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .08em; }
#game .mash-stats { color: rgba(255,255,255,.78); font-size: clamp(12px, 1.7vw, 15px); text-align: right; }
#game .mash-stage { flex: 1 1 auto; min-height: 190px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: clamp(22px, 5vw, 58px); pointer-events: none; }
#game .mash-ring-wrap { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
#game .mash-ring { width: clamp(94px, 17vw, 132px); aspect-ratio: 1; display: grid; place-items: center; border: 3px solid rgba(255,255,255,.88); border-radius: 50%; transform: scale(.78); transition: transform .18s ease, border-color .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease, background .18s ease; box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,.06), 0 12px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.2); background: rgba(255,255,255,.05); }
#game .mash-ring.inhale { transform: scale(.72); border-color: rgba(119,190,255,.9); background: rgba(63,142,218,.12); }
#game .mash-ring.exhale { transform: scale(1.1); border-color: rgba(255,218,102,.98); background: rgba(255,182,56,.18); box-shadow: 0 0 0 13px rgba(255,203,89,.08), 0 0 34px rgba(255,191,64,.26); }
#game .mash-ring.success-ring { transform: scale(1); border-color: #66efac; background: rgba(52,211,153,.2); box-shadow: 0 0 34px rgba(52,211,153,.35); }
#game .mash-ring.failure-ring { transform: scale(.9); border-color: #fb7185; background: rgba(244,63,94,.18); box-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(244,63,94,.26); }
#game .mash-ring-core { font-size: clamp(18px, 3vw, 27px); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .08em; text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
#game .mash-phase { min-height: 1.4em; font-size: clamp(15px, 2.4vw, 21px); font-weight: 800; text-align: center; }
#game .mash-cycle { color: rgba(255,255,255,.68); font-size: clamp(12px, 1.8vw, 15px); }
#game .mash-meter-box { width: min(42%, 330px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; }
#game .mash-meter-label { color: rgba(255,255,255,.76); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; }
#game .mash-meter-track { height: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2); border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(4,12,24,.52); box-shadow: inset 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.28); }
#game .mash-meter-fill { width: 0; height: 100%; border-radius: inherit; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #59b8ff, #ffd166 58%, #55e6a5); box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(95,205,255,.48); transition: width .14s ease; }
#game .mash-pad { flex: 0 0 auto; min-height: clamp(94px, 18vh, 145px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 7px; border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.34); border-radius: 22px; outline: none; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(45,104,167,.66), rgba(34,55,91,.58)); box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.2), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.18); cursor: pointer; touch-action: none; transition: transform .08s ease, border-color .15s ease, background .15s ease, opacity .15s ease; }
#game .mash-pad:hover { border-color: rgba(255,224,130,.78); background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(54,119,188,.72), rgba(42,65,104,.62)); }
#game .mash-pad:active { transform: scale(.975); }
#game .mash-pad:focus-visible { border-color: #ffe08a; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(255,224,138,.22), 0 14px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.2); }
#game .mash-pad strong { font-size: clamp(20px, 3.4vw, 31px); letter-spacing: .08em; }
#game .mash-pad span { color: rgba(255,255,255,.76); font-size: clamp(12px, 1.8vw, 15px); }
#game .mash-pad.locked { opacity: .55; cursor: default; }
#game .mash-status { flex: 0 0 auto; min-height: 24px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.76); font-size: clamp(12px, 1.8vw, 15px); text-align: center; }
#game .mash-status.warn { color: #ffe08a; }
#game .mash-status.good { color: #9df3c6; }
#game .mash-status.bad { color: #ff9aaa; }
#game .mash-result { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; z-index: 3; width: min(86%, 390px); padding: 22px 24px; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28); border-radius: 20px; background: rgba(12,21,36,.9); box-shadow: 0 20px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.38); font-size: clamp(17px, 2.7vw, 24px); font-weight: 850; line-height: 1.45; text-align: center; pointer-events: none; }
#game .mash-result.success-result { color: #9df3c6; border-color: rgba(102,239,172,.55); }
#game .mash-result.failure-result { color: #ffb1bd; border-color: rgba(251,113,133,.55); }
#game .mash-root.failure .mash-pad { animation: mash-shake .32s ease-in-out 2; }
#game .mash-root.failure .mash-meter-fill { filter: saturate(.55); }
#game .mash-root.success .mash-pad { border-color: rgba(102,239,172,.68); background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(32,139,99,.62), rgba(24,78,72,.58)); }
#game .mash-root.success .mash-meter-fill { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #55e6a5, #a7f3d0); }
@keyframes mash-shake { 0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); } 25% { transform: translateX(-7px); } 75% { transform: translateX(7px); } }
@media (max-width: 560px) {
  #game .mash-root { min-height: 300px; gap: 12px; }
  #game .mash-stage { min-height: 168px; gap: 18px; }
  #game .mash-meter-box { width: 40%; }
  #game .mash-ring { width: 88px; }
  #game .mash-hud { padding: 10px 12px; }
}"}

